<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I got cameras, homie. Smile.\nNow what you want?\rHm? Who you?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh? You want me to stitch\nyou a bag?\rSorry, that gotta wait.\rYou know The Feds?\nAh, don’t trip. I’ll tell you anyway.\rThe Feds a evil gang that\nuse homies for their dirty work.\rThey supposedly got shut down\nthree years ago.\rAnyway, they at the well choppin’\noff SlowpokeTails to sell!\rSo I’m finna go teach ’em\na lesson!\rHang on, SLOWPOKE!\nOld Kurt on the way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou handled that like a real one.\rLike I said, The Feds got\nshut down by a boy named Red three\fyears ago.\rNow they back...\nI got a bad feelin’ about it...\rAnyway, I’d be proud to\nmake custom bags for a Hustler\flike you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\fThis all I got, but take it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: I make custom bags outta\nscraps. Gator, croc, velvet, all that.\rDig ’em outta bushes and bring ’em\nto me. Don’t ask where they came from.\fI don’t.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: You got scraps for me?\fBet! I’ll stitch you a custom bag.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Takes a day to make a bag.\nCraftsmanship take TIME. Come back\flater.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Oh...\nThat’s weak. Real weak.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: I’M STITCHIN’! Don’t bother me\nor I’ll throw my slipper at you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\fI just finished your bag. Here!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Your Bag full!\nCome back when it’s lighter.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt: Came out CLEAN. Hand-stitched.\rGo snatch some homies with it.\nTell ’em Kurt sent you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The SLOWPOKE gone...\nDid bad people take ’em?\fI’m scared to go outside.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grandpa gone... He ran out the house\nyellin’ about The Feds.\fHe forgot his teeth.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The SLOWPOKE my dad gave me came\nback! Its tail grew back too! Like a\flizard!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dad work at Silph, studyin’ Nap\nSacks.\rI gotta stay home with Grandpa and\nSLOWPOKE. Grandpa yell at TV. SLOWPOKE\fdon’t do nothin’. Boring.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah!\nI’ll give you my grandpa’s number. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved Kurt’s number\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My grandpa can tell you more\nabout the bushes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">No? Why? You don’t wanna talk to my\ngrandpa? He’s lonely! He talks to\fbushes!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You DO wanna talk to my grandpa,\ndon’t you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE: ...\nYawn?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You see three people, with scenery\nin the background.\rIt’s Kurt, Professor Oak, and...\nin the middle,\fa lady with a hard stare.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s a statue of the forest’s\nprotector. Somebody left it a soda and\fa scratch-off.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The radio on.\rIt’s Professor Oak’s Pokémon Talk!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0571_T23R0501_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The radio sayin’ The Feds\nis back!</language>
	</row>
</body>
